Run from the workspace root in WSL:

  bash executor/tests/run-sdl-pixel-tests.sh

Checks the SDL presentation conversion at 1, 2, 4 and 8 bits per pixel.
Every clipping range is compared with known palette indices, with guards
before and after the destination. Odd pixel boundaries exercise packed
pixels shared with areas outside the updated rectangle.

Manual regression: launch SimCity 1.4c with creator MCRP's four-bit
configuration, start a city and build a road. Also check Browser at eight
bits and host resizing without changing Macintosh window sizes.
